*~

# Calculation examples
*.molden
# ...except the ones under test/: the active-space moldens behind the Supporting
# Information orbital figures, and the reference/final orbitals each published run
# wrote beside its results.  Without this the figures have no input in the archive.
!test/**/*.molden

